| editorial =
'''The bond and the break'''

The Kuroshio bond fractured tonight at Naruto Arena. KAZUKI and Leoni were forced to team against Big Stan and Diallo. They won by disqualification. Jusuf interfered. The tension was visible after the bell.

The Island Invasion Tour is August 9. Fangatapu. Vaiahi. 12,000 tickets sold in 6 hours. A second show was added. The demand is real. The question is whether the bond survives until then.

NOPW is a story told in a ring. The Kuroshio bond is the story. The break is the drama. The audience pays to find out if the bond holds or shatters. That is the business. That is the art. The business and the art are the same thing.

